<div class="page-content">

  <h1>The Casey Fund</h1>

  <img src="/amigos-del-parque/images/casey_fund_logo_final_sml.png"
       alt="The Casey Fund logo, with a photo of Bruce 'Casey' Stengel wearing a sun hat"
       style="max-width: 500px; width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto 2em auto;">

  <p>
    Bruce &ldquo;Casey&rdquo; Stengel was a valued member of the Boquete community and a friend
    of Parque Biblioteca Boquete. He was a kind and gentle person who valued the nature and
    tranquillity of Boquete. He loved the park, its beauty, and the sense of community it
    represents.
  </p>

  <p>
    Following Casey&rsquo;s tragic death, his friends established a memorial fund in his honor.
    Contributions to the Casey Fund will be dedicated to Parque Biblioteca Boquete, creating a
    lasting tribute to Casey in a place that meant so much to him.
  </p>

